no\ classes\ that\ reside\ outside\ of\ packages\ ['com.ulticode.modules.auth..',\ 'com.ulticode.modules.user..']\ should\ call\ method\ User.setRole(String),\ because\ P2-DISC-005\:\ Only\ Auth\ account\ adapters\ and\ User\ provisioning\ ports\ may\ write\ to\ User\:\:setRole.\ Admin\ and\ other\ foreign\ modules\ must\ route\ role\ changes\ through\ backend-auth\ RoleAdministrationService.=509319a8-0585-4976-bbac-b4ac2da61bda
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.moderation..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.user..',\ because\ Moderation\ reaches\ users\ via\ Auth\ RPC\ (C)\ or\ event\ (E),\ not\ direct\ User/UserMapper.\ See\ ADR-MIG-ARCH-BOUNDARY.=85651ef4-a586-4c66-a3f4-e0fecdb48092
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.admin..'\ should\ call\ method\ where\ call\ a\ WRITE\ method\ (insert/update/delete)\ on\ a\ foreign\ mapper,\ because\ P3-OWNER-001-F\:\ Admin\ module\ must\ route\ all\ domain\ entity\ writes\ through\ owner\ ports\ (ProblemOwnerPort,\ ContestOwnerPort,\ SubmissionOwnerPort,\ ForumOwnerPort,\ SolutionOwnerPort)\ rather\ than\ calling\ foreign\ Mapper\ write\ methods\ directly.\ See\ MICROSERVICE_MIGRATION_GUIDE.md\ \u00A710.=da138919-591b-4c22-a814-01db46cd09c4
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.submission..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.queue.service..',\ because\ Submission\ depends\ on\ queue\ ports\ only.\ QueueService\ is\ internal;\ JudgeQueue\ port\ is\ the\ public\ surface.\ See\ ADR-MIG-ARCH-BOUNDARY.=7c71e790-1f82-45d1-a541-e4c35b3f2106
no\ classes\ that\ do\ not\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'com.ulticode.modules.auth.account.DefaultAuthAccountAdapter'\ and\ do\ not\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'com.ulticode.modules.user.port.DefaultUserProfileAdapter'\ should\ call\ method\ where\ call\ a\ WRITE\ method\ (insert/update/delete)\ on\ UserMapper,\ because\ P3-OWNER-002\:\ Only\ user\ port\ adapters\ (UserProfilePort)\ and\ auth\ account\ adapters\ (AuthAccountPort)\ may\ call\ WRITE\ methods\ on\ UserMapper.\ Foreign\ modules\ (admin,\ moderation,\ etc.)\ must\ use\ owner\ ports.=9f84294d-8f0d-474c-9ac4-1eeac69be768
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.admin..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['com.ulticode.modules.contest.mapper..',\ 'com.ulticode.modules.contest.service..'],\ because\ Admin\ reads\ Contest\ via\ Q/E\ (RPC/outbox)\ or\ the\ new\ Phase\ 3\ owner\ port\ (com.ulticode.modules.contest.port..),\ not\ direct\ Mapper/Service.\ See\ ADR-MIG-ARCH-BOUNDARY\ for\ the\ frozen\ baseline\ and\ burn-down\ list.=db176a3c-cf13-4017-a225-73c8bab408a0
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.submission..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['com.ulticode.modules.queue.outbox..'],\ because\ Submission\ depends\ on\ queue\ ports\ only.\ Reaching\ queue.outbox\ (JudgeOutboxRecord/Mapper,\ dispatcher,\ reaper)\ is\ internal\ to\ the\ queue\ module.\ See\ ADR-MIG-ARCH-BOUNDARY.=2a7b7910-c2d2-4d2d-b7f1-fbe4c220f629
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.submission..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.queue.outbox..',\ because\ Submission\ depends\ on\ queue\ ports\ only.\ Reaching\ queue.outbox\ (JudgeOutboxRecord/Mapper,\ dispatcher,\ reaper)\ is\ internal\ to\ the\ queue\ module.\ See\ ADR-MIG-ARCH-BOUNDARY.=b95f3187-eda7-4702-9eed-fa3f85e355de
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ outside\ of\ packages\ ['com.ulticode.modules.user.port..',\ 'com.ulticode.modules.auth..',\ 'com.ulticode.auth..']\ should\ call\ method\ where\ call\ a\ WRITE\ method\ (insert/update/delete)\ on\ UserMapper,\ because\ P3-OWNER-002\:\ Only\ user\ port\ adapters\ (UserProfilePort)\ and\ auth\ account\ adapters\ (AuthAccountPort)\ may\ call\ WRITE\ methods\ on\ UserMapper.\ Foreign\ modules\ (admin,\ moderation,\ etc.)\ must\ use\ owner\ ports.=4b7f4adc-b39f-4435-878a-a9bc53b971c4
